      "output": "Title: Solve for y 7y=84\nURL: https://www.mathway.com/popular-problems/Basic%20Math/62862\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nSolve for y 7y=84 | Mathway\n...\nSolve for y 7y=84\n...\nDivide each term in by .\n...\nSimplify the left side.\n...\nDivide by .\n\n---\n\nTitle: Solucion de 7y=84\nURL: https://www.soluciones.lat/7y=84\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nSolucion de 7y=84\n...\n## Solución simple y rápida para la ecuación 7y=84. Nuestra respuesta es comprensible y explicada paso a paso.\n...\n## Solucion de 7y=84:\n...\n```\n7y=84\n...\nMovemos todos los personajes a la izquierda:\n...\n7y-(84)=0\n...\nMovemos todos los términos que contienen y al lado izquierdo, todos los demás términos al lado derecho\n7y=84\ny=84/7\ny=12\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n\n```\n...\nEl resultado de la ecuación 7y=84 para usar en su tarea doméstica.\n\n---\n\nTitle: 7y-84=2y+61\nURL: https://www.symbolab.com/popular-algebra/algebra-4599\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n7y-84=2y+61\n...\n# 7y-84=2y+61\n...\n7 y− 84= 2 y+ 61\n...\ny= 29\n...\n7 y= 2 y+ 145\n...\n5 y= 145\n...\ny= 29\n...\n- ### What is the answer to 7y-84=2y+61 ?\n...\nThe answer to 7y-84=2y+61 is y=29\n- ### Solve for y: 7y-84=2y+61\n...\nThe solution is y=29\n\n---\n\nTitle: If xy + 7y = 84 and x + 7 = 3, then what is the value of y?\nURL: https://testbook.com/question-answer/if-xy-7y-84-and-x-7-3-then-what-is-the-va--646c92f9593c0b205f24cd2d\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n[Solved] If xy + 7y = 84 and x + 7 = 3, then what is the value of y?\n...\n# If xy + 7y = 84 and x + 7 = 3, then what is the value of y?\n...\nOption 4 : 28\n...\nGiven Data:\n\n1. xy + 7y = 84\n\n2. x + 7 = 3\n...\nTo find the value of y, we can substitute the value of x from the second equation into the first equation.\n...\nLet's solve for x and then substitute it into the first equation:\n...\nx + 7 = 3\n\n⇒ x = 3 - 7\n\n⇒ x = -4\n...\nSubstituting the value of x into the first equation:\n...\nxy + 7y = 84\n\n⇒ (-4)y + 7y = 84\n\n⇒ -4y + 7y = 84\n\n⇒ 3y = 84\n\n⇒ y = 84 / 3\n\n⇒ y = 28\n...\nTherefore, the value of y is 28. Hence, the correct answer is option 4) 28.\n\n Last updated on Jan 20, 2026 \n\n-> The WB Police Constable Interview Exam Date 2025-26 is out on the official website. The examination begin from 29th January\n...\n2026.\n\n---\n\nTitle: Решите уравнение y*7=84 (у  умножить на 7 равно 84) - Найдите корень уравнения подробно по-шагам. [Есть ответ!]\nURL: https://www.kontrolnaya-rabota.ru/s/equal-one/any-uravnenie/e/u_umnozhit_na_sem_ravno_vosem_desyat_chety_re/\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: Ivan Petukhov\nHighlights:\nРешите уравнение y*7=84 (у умножить на 7 равно 84) - Найдите корень уравнения подробно по-шагам. [Есть ответ!]\n...\n```\ny*7 = 84\n```\n\n$$y 7 = 84$$\n\n Подробное решение \n\nДано линейное уравнение: \n\n```\ny*7 = 84\n```\n\n Разделим обе части ур-ния на 7 \n\n```\ny = 84 / (7)\n```\n\n Получим ответ: y = 12\n\n Быстрый ответ [src]\n...\n```\ny1 = 12\n...\n```\ny1 = 12.0\n\n---\n\nTitle: Suppose that y varies directly with x and that \\( y=84 \\) when \\( x=7 \\). What is the value of x when \\( y=108 \\) - SmartSolve.ai\nURL: https://smartsolve.ai/question/suppose-that-y-varies-directly-with-x-and-that-y84-when-x7-what-is-the-value-of-x-when-y108-101-12-9-10\nPublished: 2025-02-27T18:35:29.000Z\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\nSuppose that y varies directly with x and that \\( y=84 \\) when \\( x=7 \\). What is the value of x when \\( y=108 \\) - SmartSolve.ai\n...\n# Suppose that y varies directly with x and that \\( y=84 \\) when \\( x=7 \\). What is the value of x when \\( y=108 \\) ? 101 12 9 10\n...\nSince \\(y\\) varies directly with \\(x\\), we can express this relationship as \\(y = kx\\), where \\(k\\) is the constant of variation. First, we need to find \\(k\\) using the given values \\(y = 84\\) and \\(x = 7\\).\n...\n1. Substitute the values into the equation: \\(84 = k(7)\\) 2. Solve for \\(k\\): \\(k = \\frac{84}{7} = 12\\) Now we have the equation \\(y = 12x\\). Next, we need to find the value of \\(x\\) when \\(y = 108\\). 3. Substitute \\(y = 108\\) into the equation: \\(108 = 12x\\) 4. Solve for \\(x\\): \\(x = \\frac{108}{12} = 9\\)\n\n---\n\nTitle: Solve linear equation -7y=84\nURL: https://www.tiger-algebra.com/en/solution/linear-equation-one-unknown/-7y%3D84/\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: N/A\nHighlights:\n-7y=84 - Solve linear equation with one unknown | Tiger Algebra\n...\n# Solution - Linear equations with one unknown\n...\ny=−12\n...\ny=-12\n...\n### 1. Isolate the y\n...\n−7y=84\n...\nDivide both sides by -7:\n...\n(-7y)-7=84-7\n...\nCancel out the negatives:\n...\n7y7=84-7\n...\nSimplify the fraction:\n...\ny=84-7\n...\nMove the negative sign from the denominator to the numerator:\n...\ny=-847\n...\nFind the greatest common factor of the numerator and denominator:\n...\ny=(-12·7)(1·7)\n...\nFactor out and cancel the greatest common factor:\n...\ny=−12\n\n---\n\nTitle: Solve these simultaneous equations: 7x+3y=84, 2x+2y=32 | MyTutor\nURL: https://www.mytutor.co.uk/answers/56009/GCSE/Maths/Solve-these-simultaneous-equations-7x-3y-84-2x-2y-32\nPublished: N/A\nAuthor: MyTutor\nHighlights:\nx+3y=84,\n...\n2x+2y=32 | My\n...\n# Solve these simultaneous\n...\n: 7x+3y=84, 2x+2y=32\n...\nMake x the subject of either equation:x = (32-2y)/2;x = 16-yRepresent an equation as a function of y only: 7(16-y)+3y = 84;112-7y+3y = 84;112-4y = 84;-4y = -28; y = 7Use the value of y to determine value of x:2x = 32 - 2y;x=9",
